  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To help create more accountable &amp; transparent local governance towards providing improved water supply, sanitation &amp; low carbon growth, especially for poor people across 14 cities in MP. is a component of Madhya Pradesh Urban Infrastructure Investment Project reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;13,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Urban development and management.</narrative>
